Package: AnnotationBreakpoint
Title: Annotation Reassignment Sensitivity Reference and Search
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Youshan", "Heng", email = "youshan@ualberta.ca",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2758-171X"))
Description: Implements exact reference enumeration and practical fixed-prefix
    search for constrained cell-label reassignment sensitivity of a registered
    donor-level expression effect. The package distinguishes replay-verified
    upper bounds, exact minima, exhaustive stability, and unresolved no-hits.
